  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger, and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the beurre-monte and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "Add the barramundi fillets and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Remove the skillet from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
